
Overview :-
This Model Help Use to Predict What will Be Final Price of a House Based On given Dataset ie- Bedroom,bathroom etc.

-->>LIBRARIES USED :-
->NUMPY.
->PANDAS.
->MATPLOTLIB.
->SEABORN.
->SCIKET-LEARN.

->THis Project Include :-

1-EDA :-
Firstly I did Exploratory Data Analyse With The help of libraries ie-(Pandas,Numpy,Seaborn,Matplot,Sciket_learn).
Where I understand Relationship Amoung Various Column Present in dataset With the help of graph and eda.

2-HANDLING MISSING VALUES:-
There Is no Missing Value in Dataset . 

3--PREPROCESSING :-
During Preprocessing I Apply OneHotEncoder On column Location,Garage So I can change Categorical Into Numerical Value.
And Standard Scaler On COlumns Year And AreaBuilt. 
Therefore My ML Model Perform Better

4--Machine Learning Model :-
I Choose Linear_Regression,Random_Forest_RegressorXGBREgressor for this Data Set.
Amoung Them Linear_Regression Perform Best .



-->>OBSERVATION :-
->Downtown Has Highest No Houses.
->It is Clearly Shown That Every Type of House In term Of Area,Condition are Present in Every Price Range.
->Almost Same Price For House Have Garage Or Not.
->NO OUTLIER IN PRICE,AREA COLUMNS.
->Downtown Has The Best Variety of House Whereas Rural Has the least.
->MODELS	MEAN_ABSOLUTE_ERROR
Linear_Regression--243453.001139
Random_Forest_Regressor--254537.369200
XGBRegressor--254537.369200



